[Rag.index()]
    ├── 1. Start execution timer (time.time())
    ├── 2. Invoke index_files(max_chunk_size)
    │      ├── Scan data/raw/vllm-0.10.1 (retrieve_files)
    │      ├── Split files using dual strategies (load_and_split)
    │      ├── Extract text & character ranges (get_metadata)
    │      ├── Tokenize corpus terms (bm25s.tokenize)
    │      └── Save BM25 index & corpus to data/processed/bm25_index
    ├── 3. Invoke chromadb_indexing(max_chunk_size)
    │      ├── Validate presence of data/raw/vllm-0.10.1
    │      ├── Scan & split files again (retrieve_files & load_and_split)
    │      ├── Generate unique IDs (f"{source}_{start_index}") & check uniqueness
    │      ├── Initialize PersistentClient at data/processed/chroma_index
    │      └── Batch insert embeddings (BATCH_SIZE=600) into "rag_collection"
    └── 4. Calculate elapsed time & print completion message to stdout



